# Prototype D3 R11 corpus — the modal dialog session (F2.11)
#
# one modal dialog over a dimmed frame: a message, a detail line, three actions and a dismiss affordance.
# A dialog is a window role of its own (§8.1), so it is counted as a screen rather than as part of the
# window that opened it.

screen dialog
  use Frame 1
  use Label 2
  use Dialog 1
  use Button 3
end
